#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:0
msgid ""
"Turn off Windows BitLocker disk encryption so that Ubuntu can access your "
"data and be installed alongside Windows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:7
msgid "Topics: Installation Security Windows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:11
msgid "Turn off BitLocker in Windows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:13
msgid ""
"You can disable the BitLocker disk encryption used by Windows so that Ubuntu "
"can access the data. This might be necessary to install Ubuntu alongside "
"Windows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:15
msgid ""
"To learn more about BitLocker and its implications for Ubuntu, see {ref}"
"`bitlocker-during-ubuntu-installation`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:18
msgid ""
"Certain versions of Windows will no longer allow you to re-enable BitLocker "
"after disabling it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:20
msgid ""
"If you wish to re-encrypt your Windows partition after installing Ubuntu "
"alongside it, check that your version of Windows supports this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:23
msgid "Back up your data:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:25
msgid ""
"Any encryption procedure, hard drive structure change or installation of new "
"operating systems on a hard drive that already contains data can potentially "
"lead to a data loss. Make sure that your personal data is safe. Even simply "
"copying the important files to an external drive minimizes the risk of data "
"loss."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:27
msgid "Disable encryption:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:0
msgid "On Windows 11"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:32
msgid ""
"Open the Settings app and go to {menuselection}`Privacy & Security --> "
"Device Encryption`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:34
msgid "Toggle it off."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:0
msgid "On earlier Windows releases"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:38
msgid ""
"Go to {menuselection}`Control Panel --> System and Security --> BitLocker "
"Drive Encryption`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:41
msgid ""
"If the status is \"BitLocker waiting for activation\", it means that "
"BitLocker is enabled but your data isn't encrypted yet. Enable BitLocker "
"first by clicking {guilabel}`Turn on BitLocker`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:44
msgid "Click {guilabel}`Turn off BitLocker` to disable encryption."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:46
msgid ""
"![The BitLocker Drive Encryption settings in Windows](/images/bitlocker-"
"drive-encryption.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:46
msgid "The BitLocker Drive Encryption settings in Windows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:49
msgid "Windows informs you that it is going to decrypt the data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:51
msgid "![The Turn off BitLocker dialog](/images/turn-off-bitlocker.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:51
msgid "The Turn off BitLocker dialog"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:53
msgid "Wait until it's done."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:55
msgid ""
"![The BitLocker decryption progress dialog](/images/bitlocker-decryption-"
"progres.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:55
msgid "The BitLocker decryption progress dialog"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:57
msgid ""
"![The BitLocker decryption notice](/images/bitlocker-decryption-complete.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:57
msgid "The BitLocker decryption notice"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:59
msgid "Once the decryption is complete, reboot the computer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:61
msgid ""
"Log into Windows. Make sure everything works correctly and that all your "
"data is intact."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:63
msgid "The Windows data is now accessible to Ubuntu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/turn-off-bitlocker-in-windows.md:65
msgid ""
"If you're installing Ubuntu, you can now reboot your computer and launch the "
"Ubuntu installer. The hard disk configuration step can proceed."
msgstr ""
